# Cross-Language Information Access to Multilingual Collections on the Internet.

**Authors:** Bian, Guo-Wei, Chen, Hsin-Hsi

## Abstract
Discussion of language barriers when using multilingual digital library collections on the Internet focuses on query translation and document translation in a Chinese-English information retrieval system called MTIR. Highlights include a bilingual dictionary; machine transliteration algorithm; design issues for document translation; HTML tags; and speed performance versus translation performance. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ606873

